  <item>
    <title>Tame Impala: Deadbeat Tour with Djo — August 9, 2026</title>
    <link>https://heartslibrary.com/feed.html#post-2026-08-09-deadbeat-tour</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://heartslibrary.com/feed.html#post-2026-08-09-deadbeat-tour</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 00:07:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p>Got these tickets months ago and only found out tonight he was opening for Tame Impala. Shooting from the floor, hands shaking. Will edit the good ones later.</p><p><img src="https://heartslibrary.com/photos/deadbeat-tour/dsc03707.jpg" alt="Green and red beams flood the crowd as a singer grips a handheld mic"></p>]]></description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Shelby Park — August 6, 2026</title>
