    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 19:40:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p>Walked the greenway after work, shot maybe forty frames, kept none of them. Still glad I brought the camera. Some evenings that is the entire report.</p>]]></description>
