    <description><![CDATA[<p>Spent way too long here. Worth it.</p><p><img src="https://heartslibrary.com/photos/sandiego-zoo/web/gorilla-1.jpg" alt="A gorilla seen through green foliage"></p><p><img src="https://heartslibrary.com/photos/sandiego-zoo/web/gorilla-2.jpg" alt="A gorilla sitting among green fronds, looking up and away"></p><p><img src="https://heartslibrary.com/photos/sandiego-zoo/web/orangutan.jpg" alt="A close view of an orangutan's face"></p>]]></description>
